{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"保留了想到这个人时的柔软和想靠近的愿望，没有新增具体身份、往事或实际场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“想到一旦让对方知道这份心意，关系可能就会变样”把 B2 中说出心意后关系改变的比喻转成了他真实的心理顾虑，新增了具体的人物关系及退缩原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"两条线先交代想靠近的愿望，再交代退缩，前后变化清楚，单读也能理解。\",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R2\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“想让这份喜欢多停留一会儿”的愿望没有保留；修补后只留下收住的动作，并用关系可能改变的顾虑替代了原来的心理内容。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“想到一旦让对方知道这份心意，关系可能就会变样”是为贴合 B2 增补的具体解释，属于把珠子内容直接写进心理线的问题；应改用不把比喻当成实际经历的心理原因来解释退缩。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "befe6ceb-718b-42fb-b752-f6dfee2b2327", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T060140288718Z", "elapsed_seconds": 222.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:05:23.047223+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d6eb9276930455d2e78c729f30e218a0c9f0bf0eb5d7fdc06af6f9caa2bfb31b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automati